#: org.kde.Ikona.appdata.xml:6
msgid "Ikona is a design companion to help you design icons"
msgstr "Ikona é un acompañante de deseño para axudarlle a deseñar iconas"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.Ikona.appdata.xml:8
msgid ""
"Ikona is a companion application that help you when designing icons. Ikona "
"lets you visualize your icons in an environment similar to a Plasma desktop, "
"access the Breeze color palette and export your icons in multiple sizes."
msgstr ""

